==English==
[[File:High-five.jpg|thumb|upright|People performing a high five.]]
{{wikipedia|lang=en}}
{{commonscat|High fives}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|high-five}}

===Etymology===
{{com|en|high|five}}. The ''five'' refers to the five fingers of each hand.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/haɪ faɪv/}}
* {{IPA|en|/haɪ faɪv/|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[gesture]] of [[celebration]] or [[victory]] in which two people [[slap]] the palms of their [[hand]]s [[together]] at [[shoulder]] height or higher.
# A game which uses a technique providing a user with an emotional reward after they complete a minor task or achievement.
# {{lb|en|card games|uncountable}} The game of {{l|en|cinch}}.

